                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2020-8252\nSeverity: high\nPackage: node\nVersion: 10.8.0\nFix Version: 10.22.1,12.18.4,14.9.0\nType: binary\nLocation: /usr/local/bin/node\nData Namespace: nvd:cpe\nLink: [CVE-2020-8252](https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2020-8252)",
